15	// Each row shows what the person has claimed and lists their claims; the sheet's claimed-total
16	// adds everyone's up. Only OPEN and SETTLED claims count toward any of these totals. Each claim shows
17	// what is due at the rate for the person's grade in force on the claim's date (a settled claim the
