19	// the sheet's due-total adds up every person's due-total that has one. A live due is never below
20	// the sheet's floor (a figure fixed when settled, bound by a statement or by closing a period keeps its own).
21	// Taking a person's statement binds each of their claims that counts to the figure it has then
22	// (a stated claim shows and totals that figure); each row shows how many statements the person
23	// has taken, and the last one's due-total and date.
24	// Each claim shows the period its date falls in, and each period the due of the claims that count in it.
25	// A person can be retired from a date (the sheet's today when left blank); with a date set they count
